=🛑 *Desert Comfort LiveKit — Agent appears DOWN*

*Last heartbeat seen:* {{ $json.last_seen || 'never' }}
*Minutes since:* {{ $json.minutes_since !== null ? Math.round($json.minutes_since) : 'unknown' }}
*What happened:* The agent has not pinged its heartbeat webhook in over 20 minutes. It may be crashed, restarted without the service coming back up, or network-isolated from n8n.
*Action Required:* SSH in and check `sudo systemctl status desert-comfort-agent.service`. This alert will not repeat until the agent recovers.

=✅ *Desert Comfort LiveKit — Agent back up*

*Last heartbeat seen:* {{ $json.last_seen }}
*What happened:* The agent resumed sending its heartbeat after an outage. No action needed unless calls were missed during the gap — check the outbox/ledger for that window.

