=⚠️ *Desert Comfort LiveKit — Drift Watchman: real booking not reflected in our stage*

*Contact:* {{ $json.contact_id }}
*Appointment:* {{ $json.appointment_id }} ({{ $json.calendar_type }} calendar, status '{{ $json.status }}', {{ $json.start_time }})
*Contact's current stage:* {{ $json.stage || '(blank)' }}
*What happened:* GHL's calendar has a real, active appointment for this contact, but our stage field never reflects it as booked (or served). Most likely cause: a missed appointment-status webhook, or the appointment was created directly in GHL without going through the agent.
*Action Required:* Check this contact and appointment in GHL. Nothing was changed automatically.

